#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/privacy-level.rst:2
msgid "Privacy levels"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/shared/admonition-rtd-business.rst:2
msgid ""
"This feature is only available on `Read the Docs Business "
"<https://app.readthedocs.com/>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/privacy-level.rst:6
msgid ""
"Privacy levels allow you to set the visibility of your project and its "
"versions. This allows you to specify what information is available to the"
" public and what is private. Privacy can be controlled at the level of "
"the project and each version, and nothing more granular (eg. specific "
"directories or URLs) can be controlled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/privacy-level.rst:12
msgid "Project privacy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/privacy-level.rst:14
msgid ""
"By default, only users that belong to your organization can see the "
"dashboard of your project and its builds. If you want users outside your "
"organization to be able to see the dashboard of your project, and the "
"build output of *public versions* you can set the privacy level of your "
"project to ``Public``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/privacy-level.rst:18
msgid ""
"You can set the project privacy level in your project's "
":menuselection:`Settings` by changing :guilabel:`Privacy level` to "
"`Public`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/privacy-level.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Making a project public doesn't give access to any versions.** So if "
"you want all your versions to be accessible, you need to configure those "
"to be `Public` as well."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/privacy-level.rst:26
msgid "Version privacy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/privacy-level.rst:28
msgid ""
"Each version of your documentation can be set to either `Public` or "
"`Private`. This allows you to control who can see the documentation for a"
" specific version."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/privacy-level.rst:31
msgid "Documentation for public versions is visible to everyone."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/privacy-level.rst:32
msgid ""
"Private versions are available only to people who have permissions to see"
" them. They will not display on any list view, and will 404 when visited "
"by people without viewing permissions. If you want to share your docs "
"temporarily, see :doc:`/commercial/sharing`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/privacy-level.rst:36
msgid ""
"You can set the privacy level for each version in your project's "
":menuselection:`Versions` tab: open the dot menu for the version, select "
":guilabel:`Configure version`, and change :guilabel:`Privacy Level` to "
"`Public`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/privacy-level.rst:39
msgid "Recommended workflow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/privacy-level.rst:41
msgid ""
"We recommend defaulting everything to private, and only making versions "
"public when you are ready to share them with the world. This allows you "
"to work on your documentation in private, and only share it when you are "
"ready."
msgstr ""

